Description:
TV-specific Compose material controls. Two unmodified Google Maven AARs,
vendored so checkout/build needs no dependency resolution or unpinned download.
The pinned Chromium Compose/Kotlin targets supply the remaining dependencies.
Minimum Android API is 23; the browser requires a higher minimum.

